{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37250","headline":"变体诗 · 章谒","name":"变体诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东南路尽吴江畔，正是穷愁暮雨天。\n鸥鹭不嫌斜两岸，波涛欺得逆风船。\n偶逢岛寺停帆看，深羡渔翁下钓眠。\n今古若论英达筭，鸱夷高兴固无边。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章谒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}